{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640040","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1064004001:1":{"text":"荒涼の砂漠に月の光が降り注ぐ頃、ソーンの案内のもと、あなたたちは砂漠の巨獣の骨を手に入れた。","source_cn":"月光洒满荒角沙漠时，你们在索恩的带领下，获得了远古沙漠...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064004002:1":{"text":"翌日の朝。混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋に必要な一つ目の食材を手に入れたあなたたちは、アルサとソーンに別れを告げた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1064004003:1":{"text":"そして、今度はヴァレンのツテで帆船を借り、大海原へ繰り出した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:4:418:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">【材料1：太古の生き物の骨】</style>\n必ず、千年以上生きた生物であること。砂漠の巨獣の骨は、長い年月をかけて大地の気を吸収しているため、最も理想的。\n銀製の器具で、月が出ている夜に採取すること。間違っても鉄製品で触れてはならない。\n \n<style=\"highlight\">【材料2：海底生物の肝臓】</style>\n特に重要な材料。海底に生息する古の種族であること、日が差さない場所であればあるほど好ましい。\n採取後の肝臓は、生息場所の水に浸けて保管し、絶対に空気に触れさせてはならない。","source_cn":"<style=\"highlight\">【材料一·远古生物骨骼】</style>\n远古生物骨骼必须来自存活超过千年的生物，沙漠巨兽最为理想，其骨骼经历漫长岁月吸收了大地精华。\n切割需在有月光的夜晚，使用银制工具，切忌使用铁器碰触。\n \n<style=\"highlight\">【材料二·海底生物的肝脏】</style>\n海底生物的肝脏选取尤为关键。应选择生活在海底的古老种族，越是不见天日者越佳。\n采集后的肝脏必须保存在原生环境的水中，切不可接触空气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE19C5B5C66C9B8FB","variant_status":"","male":"<style=\"highlight\">【材料1：太古の生き物の骨】</style>\n必ず、千年以上生きた生物であること。砂漠の巨獣の骨は、長い年月をかけて大地の気を吸収しているため、最も理想的。\n銀製の器具で、月が出ている夜に採取すること。間違っても鉄製品で触れてはならない。\n \n<style=\"highlight\">【材料2：海底生物の肝臓】</style>\n特に重要な材料。海底に生息する古の種族であること、日が差さない場所であればあるほど好ましい。\n採取後の肝臓は、生息場所の水に浸けて保管し、絶対に空気に触れさせてはならない。","female":"<style=\"highlight\">【材料1：太古の生き物の骨】</style>\n必ず、千年以上生きた生物であること。砂漠の巨獣の骨は、長い年月をかけて大地の気を吸収しているため、最も理想的。\n銀製の器具で、月が出ている夜に採取すること。間違っても鉄製品で触れてはならない。\n \n<style=\"highlight\">【材料2：海底生物の肝臓】</style>\n特に重要な材料。海底に生息する古の種族であること、日が差さない場所であればあるほど好ましい。\n採取後の肝臓は、生息場所の水に浸けて保管し、絶対に空気に触れさせてはならない。","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":"no_source_text"},"say:5:1064004004:0":{"text":"海底生物の肝臓かあ……範囲が広すぎない？","source_cn":"海底生物的肝脏……这个范围也太广了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x404DA71EC218C584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064004005:1":{"text":"何の生き物がいいのかな？","source_cn":"到底该选择什么生物呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x826F6DC22CECDE62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064004006:1":{"text":"鮫とかはどうだ？","source_cn":"鲨鱼怎么样？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7F168C820FDC4733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064004007:1":{"text":"普通の生き物じゃ意味がないんじゃないか？","source_cn":"普通海洋生物的肝脏应该不够格吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD5D8155327E4C1B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064004008:0":{"text":"本には、海底に住む古の種族って書いてあるんだろ？","source_cn":"食谱上说要生活在海底的古老种族……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x99B12C74D06B9E1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064004009:1":{"text":"マーリンさんはどう思う？","source_cn":"梅林有什么建议吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8351418F360661F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1064004009":{"text":"マーリンさんはどう思う？","source_cn":"梅林有什么建议吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8351418F360661F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064004010:0":{"text":"もしかして、知性を持ってる魔物？……だめ、それは残酷すぎる！","source_cn":"该不会是有智慧的魔物吧？……不行，那样太残酷了！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xE410D1C2EE957A1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064004011:0":{"text":"なら、人魚は？","source_cn":"唔，人鱼呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6785CF04A05A0009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064004012:0":{"text":"絶対に、だめー！","source_cn":"绝对不行！<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBF428993CE787FEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064004013:1":{"text":"そうだぞ、亜人系には手を出さないって約束しただろ！","source_cn":"没错，我们说好不对亚人系生物下手的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECE1CBF1CFE6A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064004013":{"text":"そうだぞ、亜人系には手を出さないって約束しただろ！","source_cn":"没错，我们说好不对亚人系生物下手的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECE1CBF1CFE6A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064004014:0":{"text":"いやー！名前からして気持ち悪いやつじゃない！","source_cn":"不要！听起来就很恶心！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xAC78BCFDCCC389C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064004014":{"text":"いやー！名前からして気持ち悪いやつじゃない！","source_cn":"不要！听起来就很恶心！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xAC78BCFDCCC389C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064004015:0":{"text":"シレーヌってセイレーンの別名だろ？だから亜人系はだめだって――","source_cn":"冥湾美人就是赛莲的别名对吧？我说亚人系的不行啊——","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x8275C550D2EA1727","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064004016:1":{"text":"違いますよ。私たちの言うシレーヌは、深海魚なんです。","source_cn":"不是啦，我们所说的冥湾美人其实是深海鱼。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7CCE00B52FD5C5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064004017:1":{"text":"人とは似ても似つかない見た目をしていて、むしろちょっと不気味なぐらいです。","source_cn":"外表和人完全不相似，反倒是有点令人毛骨悚然。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C6963DFA1709C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064004018:1":{"text":"不気味って……本当に大丈夫なの？","source_cn":"毛骨悚然……真的没问题吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF375DCD6ADD7D33B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1064004018":{"text":"不気味って……本当に大丈夫なの？","source_cn":"虽说是鱼，但这么恐怖真的没问题吗？","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064004019:1":{"text":"しかし、深海に生息している魚をどうやって捕まえるつもりだ？","source_cn":"既然生活在深海里，我们该如何捕获它呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x97E7053F3F220235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064004020:0":{"text":"任せてください！以前、マスターと釣り上げたことがあります！","source_cn":"主人和我们之前钓到过，交给我们吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AD30769D75EB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064004021:1":{"text":"あなたたちは以前の経験を活かして特製ミミズを用意し、シレーヌが出没する海域で釣りを始めた。","source_cn":"你们根据之前的经历，准备好了特制的饵蚯，并在它常出没的...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064004022:1":{"text":"まだ釣れないのか？","source_cn":"唉，还要等多久？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2719302B5107FD9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064004023:1":{"text":"チルチャック、釣りは忍耐だぞ。","source_cn":"齐尔查克，钓鱼要耐心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x429012AACEF33400","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064004024:1":{"text":"へいへい、大人しく……待つ……","source_cn":"好吧，我等……就……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF91DCED284B4B1CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064004025:0":{"text":"チルチャック！チル！？","source_cn":"齐尔查克！齐尔查克！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE633F0961F9A0004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064004026:0":{"text":"む、歌声が聞こえるような……","source_cn":"好像有什么歌声传了过来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF226B479B285FF15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064004027:1":{"text":"これは……人魚だ！俺達をおびき寄せようとしているんだ。","source_cn":"我明白了，是人鱼——她们试图引诱我们！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4B6A3D119936CD80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064004028:0":{"text":"大丈夫、俺に任せろ！らるら～あいあ～～うらら～～！","source_cn":"交给我，我有办法！啦啦啊啊啊呜哇哇——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDD10101C1BE3AFF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:49:1064004029:1":{"text":"ライオスが最後まで歌いきった頃には、周囲の海域から人魚の姿はすっかり消えていた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:50:1064004030:1":{"text":"だが、同じ船に乗っていた人たちに逃げ場はなく……","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064004031:0":{"text":"も、もう……だめ……","source_cn":"窝……窝不行了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x22D3B75234EFDC77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064004032:1":{"text":"船酔いじゃないけど……吐きそう……","source_cn":"我要吐了，但不是因为晕船……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47160241F3989E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064004033:1":{"text":"……そんなに酷かったか？","source_cn":"……真的有这么难听吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAF93FE932654021A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:57:1064004033":{"text":"……そんなに酷かったか？","source_cn":"……真的有这么难听吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAF93FE932654021A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064004034:1":{"text":"（小声で）……シレーヌが釣れたのか？","source_cn":"（小声）是……冥湾美人上钩了吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xC69F4EFA63C7E5C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064004035:1":{"text":"動いてます！餌にかかりましたよ！","source_cn":"动了！动了！上钩了——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5AAD6A0939D81019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064004036:0":{"text":"シレーヌは激しく抵抗したが、なんとか釣り上げることができた。","source_cn":"虽然冥湾美人在剧烈挣扎，但你们仍然成功钓到了它。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x501A8F0F09B371FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064004037:1":{"text":"……み、醜い。","source_cn":"……好丑。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3CC04DA2FCA96902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:66::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"matched_item_resource","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064004038:1":{"text":"……名前とのギャップがすごい。","source_cn":"……和名字好有反差感。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDA579839EEC9C912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064004039:0":{"text":"いや、深海ではこれが美の定義なのかもしれない。見ろ、あの鋭い牙、頭の優雅な発光体、ゴツゴツした鱗――","sour